  "question": {
    "text": "In a series resonant LCR circuit, the voltage across $R$ is 100 volts and $R=1 \\mathrm{k} \\Omega$ with $C=2 \\mu \\mathrm{F}$. The resonant frequency $\\omega$ is $200 \\mathrm{rad} / \\mathrm{s}$. At resonance the voltage across $L$ is"
